OL,3,CBonnie Tyler fans to line streets of
OL,4,CMumbles as coffin brought to former
OL,5,Chome
OL,7,FFans of Welsh singer Bonnie Tyler are
OL,8,Fexpected to line the streets of
OL,9,FMumbles on Saturday as her coffin is
OL,10,Ftransported back to her former home
OL,11,Fahead of her funeral on Monday.
OL,13,FThe Total Eclipse Of The Heart
OL,14,Fmusician, whose real name was Gaynor
OL,15,FHopkins, died in hospital in Portugal
OL,16,Fon July 8 at the age of 75.
OL,18,FShe will be laid to rest following a
OL,19,Fcelebration of life service and
OL,20,Fprocession.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
