OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786783693
OL,3,CBonnie Tyler fans to line streets of
OL,4,CMumbles as coffin brought to former
OL,5,Chome
OL,7,FPeople who wish to pay their respects
OL,8,Fto the late singer have been invited
OL,9,Fto line Newton Road, Mumbles, as the
OL,10,Fcoffin is transported to her former
OL,11,Fhome, Fernhill.
OL,13,FThe singer and will return to her home
OL,14,Fin Llwynderw from William Pressdee
OL,15,FFuneralcare in Mumbles.
OL,17,FThe hearse is due to depart at
OL,18,Fapproximately 3.15pm, travelling along
OL,19,FNewton Road before continuing onto
OL,20,FMumbles Road.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
