OL,3,CBonnie Tyler fans to line streets of
OL,4,CMumbles as coffin brought to former
OL,5,Chome
OL,7,FNewton Road will be closed from the
OL,8,Fjunction with Mumbles Road, near the
OL,9,FWhite Rose, to Langland Road, near
OL,10,FOystermouth School, from around 3pm on
OL,11,FSaturday.
OL,13,FBuses will be permitted to travel
OL,14,Fthrough the closure for as long as it
OL,15,Fremains safe to do so and the road
OL,16,Fwill reopen as soon as possible after
OL,17,Fthe cortege has passed.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
