OL,3,CBonnie Tyler fans to line streets of
OL,4,CMumbles as coffin brought to former
OL,5,Chome
OL,7,FTyler's death came months after she
OL,8,Fwas treated in intensive care after
OL,9,Fbeing placed in an induced coma
OL,10,Ffollowing emergency intestinal surgery.
OL,12,FHer family said a celebration of her
OL,13,Flife will be held at Swansea Minster
OL,14,F(St Mary's Church) on Monday at noon.
OL,16,FIn lieu of flowers, the family has
OL,17,Finvited donations in support of two
OL,18,Fcharities of which Tyler served as
OL,19,Fpatron: Noah's Ark Children's Hospital
OL,20,Ffor Wales and Cerebral Palsy Cymru.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
