OL,3,CBonnie Tyler fans to line streets of
OL,4,CMumbles as coffin brought to former
OL,5,Chome
OL,7,FIt was announced in May that the
OL,8,Fsinger had been taken to hospital near
OL,9,Fher home in Faro for an emergency
OL,10,Foperation.
OL,12,FThe singer achieved international fame
OL,13,Fin the 1980s with the release of Total
OL,14,FEclipse Of The Heart, which shot to
OL,15,Fthe top of the charts in the UK and
OL,16,Fthe US.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/7
