OL,3,CBonnie Tyler fans to line streets of
OL,4,CMumbles as coffin brought to former
OL,5,Chome
OL,7,FFaster Than The Speed Of Night, the
OL,8,Falbum which featured the track, was
OL,9,Falso a chart-topping success and
OL,10,Flanded the singer her only UK number
OL,11,Fone album.
OL,13,FRecognisable for her husky voice,
OL,14,FTyler released many other hits,
OL,15,Fincluding Holding Out For A Hero, It's
OL,16,FA Heartache and If You Were A Woman
OL,17,F(And I Was A Man).
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/7
