OL,7,FShe represented the UK in the 2013
OL,8,FEurovision Song Contest in Malmo,
OL,9,FSweden, with the song Believe In Me,
OL,10,Ffinishing in 19th place.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/7
